and an easy-release mechanism for PCI Express slots.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>10/24/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of PC Masters Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcmasters.de/testbericht/133713771-asus-rog-strix-z890-f-gaming-wifi-test-review-z890-mainboard-test.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202502051635258230664.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Combined with its customizable aesthetics and durable construction, the ASUS ROG Strix Z890-F WIFI motherboard offers a balanced blend of performance, functionality, and design.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>11/01/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/review/review-asus-strix-z890f-gaming-wifi-motherboard/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1323/202501231704461860065.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9.2/10 Overall Rating\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gadget Pilipinas\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9.2/10 Overall Rating</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Overall, the ASUS ROG Strix Z890-F Gaming WIFI is a very well-rounded motherboard that tops the spec in performance, build quality, connectivity, and reliability. It’s a“if it ain’t broke, don’t fix it” approach which may seem boring, especially for those like me who sport the same tier of motherboard in every generation.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>PHILIPPINES</span> <span>11/06/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of 9.2/10 Overall Rating\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gadgetpilipinas.net/2024/11/asus-rog-strix-z890-f-gaming-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/202003062031367220176.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recomendado\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Noticias3D\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recomendado</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      excellent choice for gaming\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>10/24/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Recomendado\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.noticias3d.com/articulo/3807/asus-rog-strix-z890-f-gaming-wifi-review-excelente-eleccion-gaming.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1333/202102012346528770265.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Approved\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hwcooling.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Approved</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      In any case, we can conclude that the ROG Strix Z890-F Gaming WiFi is a perfectly prepared motherboard for the most powerful processor on the LGA 1851 platform - the Intel Core Ultra 9 285K, whose performance can be further increased by manual overclocking.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SLOVAKIA</span> <span>12/23/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Approved\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hwcooling.net/rog-strix-z890-f-gaming-wifi-tema-lga-1851-podla-asusu/37/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202501291655025280271.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Excellent Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Technology Insider\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Excellent Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Asus ROG Strix Z890-F Gaming WiFi is a very well-equipped motherboard.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>08/15/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Excellent Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.technologyinsider.nl